    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET STUNNING LADIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/e5d58e1ef475c4d849dfcc0e897996f2.avif?t=1753375311\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span><strong>SWIPE THE VIDEOS &amp; CALL HER\u00a0</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/b53c48be46d02efdd66b56c7e95c51d3.poster.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/b53c48be46d02efdd66b56c7e95c51d3.webm?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/b53c48be46d02efdd66b56c7e95c51d3.mp4?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fully interactive phone to call the girls, tell them what you want to do, and invite them over. Strengthen your relationships by sending gifts, but remember, each girl has different preferences. Some love jewelry, while others wouldn't trade a long stick for anything else.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE FUN WITH HER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/08d25da7e6212f195d93c76f98799d01.avif?t=1753375311\" width=756 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/6cb0dca348ebd3cd4e610d334c84754f.poster.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/6cb0dca348ebd3cd4e610d334c84754f.webm?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/6cb0dca348ebd3cd4e610d334c84754f.mp4?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/0e9cb095cef1da93446467fc2fd18b27.poster.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/0e9cb095cef1da93446467fc2fd18b27.webm?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/0e9cb095cef1da93446467fc2fd18b27.mp4?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE HER PHOTO AND SHARE WITH OTHER PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/366aa1d1766f31bb0ad50b9e77bb143d.poster.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/366aa1d1766f31bb0ad50b9e77bb143d.webm?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/366aa1d1766f31bb0ad50b9e77bb143d.mp4?t=1753375311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET RICH AND BUILD YOUR CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/5a15b86bf87cbbce68092c2999d58fd6.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your wallet with money and increase your passive income. Enrich yourself with mini-games and upgrade your character. This way, you can handle multiple girls at the same time! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR PHONE APPLICATIONS &amp; YOUR GAMEPLAY</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086060/extras/014efb9c7dcb44c39b7c857ca2f17255.avif?t=1753375311\" width=740 height=64 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Movement &amp; Free Cellphone:</strong> Roam around your house to your heart's content. Open and use your phone anywhere you like. Decide how to play with various different applications.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters:</strong> There are 6 different women with whom you can build and strengthen your relationships. These women like different things. How about finding the right ways to make them happy?\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roleplay!:</strong> It's up to you to develop your character. Complete tasks to collect rewards and enrich the game loop.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Social Media:</strong> Share the photos you take with people! View what they have shared!</p></li></ul>",
